  {
   "id": "0c3c9770-dccb-5480-8cba-2831763aa4e0",
   "kind": "chunk",
   "content": "Demo College of Engineering is a private engineering college affiliated to the state technical university. The campus is 40 acres and has separate academic, hostel and sports blocks.",
   "keywords": "",
   "citation": {
    "source_type": "document",
    "document_id": "d616b619-a24e-582b-b0bc-03817e3491f2",
    "qa_id": null,
    "title": "Prospectus 2027-28",
    "heading_path": "About the college",
    "page": null,
    "academic_year": "2027-28",
    "department": null,
    "valid_to": "2028-07-31",
    "url": null
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "e8fdfdea-74db-5403-8dd4-0ee28cf9447c",
   "kind": "chunk",
   "content": "Undergraduate: B.Tech in Computer Science and Engineering, Mechanical Engineering and Civil Engineering. Each B.Tech programme runs for four years (eight semesters).\n\nPostgraduate: M.Tech in Computer Science and Engineering (two years) and MBA (two years).",
   "keywords": "",
   "citation": {
    "source_type": "document",
    "document_id": "d616b619-a24e-582b-b0bc-03817e3491f2",
    "qa_id": null,
    "title": "Prospectus 2027-28",
    "heading_path": "Programmes offered",
    "page": null,
    "academic_year": "2027-28",
    "department": null,
    "valid_to": "2028-07-31",
    "url": null
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "d53fb775-342e-5158-8a4d-e4bb682a0a33",
   "kind": "chunk",
   "content": "For B.Tech, candidates must have passed 10+2 with Physics, Chemistry and Mathematics with at least 50% marks (45% for reserved categories) and hold a valid rank in the state entrance test or JEE Main.\n\nFor M.Tech, a B.E. or B.Tech in a related branch with at least 50% is required; a GATE score is preferred. For the MBA, any bachelor's degree with at least 50% and a valid CAT, MAT or PGCET score is required.",
   "keywords": "",
   "citation": {
    "source_type": "document",
    "document_id": "d616b619-a24e-582b-b0bc-03817e3491f2",
    "qa_id": null,
    "title": "Prospectus 2027-28",
    "heading_path": "Eligibility",
    "page": null,
    "academic_year": "2027-28",
    "department": null,
    "valid_to": "2028-07-31",
    "url": null
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "f36a0156-b93a-5976-93a1-1890f5ba0de3",
   "kind": "chunk",
   "content": "Diploma holders with at least 45% marks in a related branch can join the B.Tech programme directly in the second year (third semester) through the state lateral-entry test. Seats are limited to 10% of the intake.",
   "keywords": "",
   "citation": {
    "source_type": "document",
    "document_id": "d616b619-a24e-582b-b0bc-03817e3491f2",
    "qa_id": null,
    "title": "Prospectus 2027-28",
    "heading_path": "Lateral entry",
    "page": null,
    "academic_year": "2027-28",
    "department": null,
    "valid_to": "2028-07-31",
    "url": null
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "9e9d1a16-c3e4-5101-b8f4-681ccd7d455f",
   "kind": "chunk",
   "content": "1. Apply online on the admissions portal and pay the application fee.\n2. Upload your marks cards, entrance test rank card, transfer certificate and a photo ID.\n3. Attend counselling on the date given in your admission letter.\n4. Pay the first-year fee within seven days of the seat allotment to confirm your seat.\n\nYou receive an e-mail at each step. Original documents are verified at the time of joining.",
   "keywords": "",
   "citation": {
    "source_type": "document",
    "document_id": "d616b619-a24e-582b-b0bc-03817e3491f2",
    "qa_id": null,
    "title": "Prospectus 2027-28",
    "heading_path": "Admission process",
    "page": null,
    "academic_year": "2027-28",
    "department": null,
    "valid_to": "2028-07-31",
    "url": null
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "6de55090-e666-5317-8258-16fdaf2edd1a",
   "kind": "chunk",
   "content": "Class 10 and Class 12 marks cards, entrance test rank card, transfer certificate, migration certificate (for students from other boards), category certificate if applicable, Aadhaar card and four passport-size photographs.",
   "keywords": "",
   "citation": {
