   }
  },
  {
   "id": "1505f7fb-e6b1-59e4-b4fd-bd02f40dcfc8",
   "kind": "chunk",
   "content": "Merit scholarships cover part of the tuition fee for students with high entrance test ranks. Need-based fee concessions are available for families with an annual income below the limit set by the scholarship committee. Students can also apply for state and central government scholarships through the National Scholarship Portal; the scholarship cell helps with the application.",
   "keywords": "",
   "citation": {
