  {
   "id": "8015abd2-d19e-5600-9af6-9b8d823f7aba",
   "kind": "chunk",
   "content": "The programme has 160 credits over eight semesters. The first year covers mathematics, physics, programming in C and Python, and engineering drawing.",
   "keywords": "",
   "citation": {
    "source_type": "document",
    "document_id": "ab49ed87-acca-585b-9ae7-70b4164b5891",
    "qa_id": null,
    "title": "B.Tech CSE curriculum 2027-28",
    "heading_path": "Structure",
    "page": null,
    "academic_year": "2027-28",
    "department": "Computer Science",
    "valid_to": "2028-07-31",
    "url": null
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "b20c64e9-e893-5bc2-b43d-67b5fb708ec7",
   "kind": "chunk",
   "content": "Data structures, algorithms, discrete mathematics, computer organisation, operating systems, database management systems, computer networks, theory of computation, compiler design and software engineering.",
   "keywords": "",
   "citation": {
    "source_type": "document",
    "document_id": "ab49ed87-acca-585b-9ae7-70b4164b5891",
    "qa_id": null,
    "title": "B.Tech CSE curriculum 2027-28",
    "heading_path": "Core subjects",
    "page": null,
    "academic_year": "2027-28",
    "department": "Computer Science",
    "valid_to": "2028-07-31",
    "url": null
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "54f8dc02-b1ff-56cd-a265-b4294a29829c",
   "kind": "chunk",
   "content": "From the fifth semester students choose electives in machine learning, deep learning, natural language processing, cloud computing, cyber security, blockchain and the internet of things. Students may take a minor in data science.",
   "keywords": "",
   "citation": {
    "source_type": "document",
    "document_id": "ab49ed87-acca-585b-9ae7-70b4164b5891",
    "qa_id": null,
    "title": "B.Tech CSE curriculum 2027-28",
    "heading_path": "Electives",
    "page": null,
    "academic_year": "2027-28",
    "department": "Computer Science",
    "valid_to": "2028-07-31",
    "url": null
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "11859cbf-17bf-558f-95c8-331d855311c1",
   "kind": "chunk",
   "content": "The department has a programming lab, a networks lab, an AI and machine learning lab with GPU workstations, and an IoT lab. Labs are open until 20:00 on weekdays.",
   "keywords": "",
   "citation": {
    "source_type": "document",
    "document_id": "ab49ed87-acca-585b-9ae7-70b4164b5891",
    "qa_id": null,
    "title": "B.Tech CSE curriculum 2027-28",
    "heading_path": "Labs",
    "page": null,
    "academic_year": "2027-28",
    "department": "Computer Science",
    "valid_to": "2028-07-31",
    "url": null
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "26c6bff5-9434-5ed2-b534-5c4bb5804473",
   "kind": "chunk",
   "content": "Students complete a mini project in the sixth semester and a major project in the eighth semester. An internship of at least eight weeks is required before the final year.",
   "keywords": "",
   "citation": {
    "source_type": "document",
    "document_id": "ab49ed87-acca-585b-9ae7-70b4164b5891",
    "qa_id": null,
    "title": "B.Tech CSE curriculum 2027-28",
    "heading_path": "Projects and internships",
    "page": null,
    "academic_year": "2027-28",
    "department": "Computer Science",
    "valid_to": "2028-07-31",
    "url": null
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "b3ea1035-34d7-52a5-8acf-a87f67815377",
   "kind": "chunk",
   "content": "Graduates work as software engineers, data analysts, machine learning engineers and network engineers, or go on to M.Tech, MS or MBA programmes. The department helps with GATE and GRE preparation.",
   "keywords": "",
   "citation": {
    "source_type": "document",
    "document_id": "ab49ed87-acca-585b-9ae7-70b4164b5891",
    "qa_id": null,
    "title": "B.Tech CSE curriculum 2027-28",
    "heading_path": "Higher studies and careers",
    "page": null,
    "academic_year": "2027-28",
    "department": "Computer Science",
    "valid_to": "2028-07-31",
    "url": null
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "e4633b48-fe1b-55fa-bb27-2825887a0c8b",
   "kind": "chunk",
   "content": "Engineering mechanics, thermodynamics, fluid mechanics, strength of materials, manufacturing processes, machine design, heat transfer and dynamics of machinery.",
   "keywords": "",
   "citation": {
    "source_type": "document",
    "document_id": "813cc23d-1e75-5a82-a6f5-05d401ea502d",
    "qa_id": null,
