  {
   "id": "7aa8361c-7da1-5602-8a1f-330c1a0cefb0",
   "kind": "chunk",
   "content": "The hostel mess serves breakfast, lunch, evening snacks and dinner. Vegetarian and non-vegetarian food is available. The mess charge is included in the hostel fee.",
   "keywords": "",
   "citation": {
    "source_type": "document",
    "document_id": "3e85cff5-a678-5c4b-904c-753d31abd43d",
